; AmiNTP startup example for S:User-Startup
; Assumes AmiNTP is installed in C: and config in ENVARC:AmiNTP/AmiNTP.conf

; Query only, never changes the clock:
; C:AmiNTP QUERY

; Synchronize system clock and RTC:
C:AmiNTP SYNC

; Or skip RTC writes:
; C:AmiNTP SYNC NORTC

; Optional ARexx resident service:
; Run >NIL: C:AmiNTP RESIDENT
